Package: coworkingview
Type: Package
Title: Flexible Office Prices and Coworking Spaces from the 'CoworkingView' API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Carlos", "Müller González", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "info@coworkingview.com"),
    person("CoworkingView", role = "cph")
    )
Description: Retrieve the 'CoworkingView' Price Index, an open data set of
    flexible office prices by city (monthly flex desk, fixed desk and private
    office rates, daily day pass and hourly meeting room rates) licensed under
    the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 licence ('CC BY 4.0'), and search the
    'CoworkingView' catalogue of coworking spaces, event spaces, meeting rooms
    and virtual offices. Data come from the public, keyless 'CoworkingView'
    application programming interface ('API') <https://coworkingview.com/en/api>
    and are returned as tidy data frames that carry their attribution.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://coworkingview.com,
    https://github.com/coworkingview/flex-office-data
BugReports: https://github.com/coworkingview/flex-office-data/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    tibble
VignetteBuilder: knitr
